e; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">英國重要保險商調查發現，日韓企業面對氣候變遷問題表現不佳；圖為日本川崎的工廠。（路透）</span></p>\n\n<hr style=\\\"box-sizing: content-box; height: 1px; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; border: 0px; background-image: -webkit-linear-gradient(left, transparent, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2), transparent); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\" />\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\">英國法通保險（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">Legal &amp; General</span>）管理約<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">1</span>兆英鎊（約<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">1.3</span>兆美元）資產的投資管理部門<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">LGIM</span>近日發佈報告，點名日本、南韓的企業在應對全球氣候變遷方面，表現居世界主要國家之末，並指出日韓<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">2</span>國欠缺促使企業應對氣候變遷的相關規範。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\">日本《日經新聞》報導，<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">LGIM</span>調查對象為世界各地重要的<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">82</span>間企業，其中澳洲、加拿大、法國、德國、英國及美國的企業表現都較去年為佳，為日本及南韓<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">2</span>國企業表現退步。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\">LGIM</span><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\">也透過此調查，將表現墊底的幾間企業，從自家<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">50</span>億英鎊（約<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">63.3</span>億美元）的「未來世界基金」（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">Future World funds</span>）中撤資，其中就包含了南韓最大的電力公司「韓國電力公社」；<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">LGIM</span>指出，韓國電力公社在企業策略及董事會組成方面，對氣候變遷應對較差，也未注意過<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">LGIM</span>對此事的擔憂。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\">而速霸陸汽車及日本郵政等<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">2</span>間日企，已連續<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">2</span>年被列為撤資可能名單，<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">LGIM</span>認為日本郵政雖然願與<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">LGIM</span>合作，但未在公開報告中談及氣候變遷問題，也沒有揭露完整的碳排放訊息。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1e